1) Bug summary  
   The CSS highlighter’s “url” rule in `components/prism-css.js` uses a hand-rolled RegExp that doesn’t properly swallow the entire quoted URL; as a result, you end up with Prism breaking the string at “Inter:wght@300;…” and re-lexing the “:” or “;” as plain punctuation or property tokens.

